<article class="reading container policy"><h1>Privacy notice</h1><div class="prose"><p>Last updated: 4 November 2026.<br>Kaasi is developed by Aanjelo Salgado. Contact <a href="mailto:aanjelo99@gmail.com">aanjelo99@gmail.com</a> for privacy questions or requests.</p><h2>Your financial records</h2><p>Kaasi stores your accounts, transactions, budgets and preferences in your browser’s local database. You can start without an account. Clearing browser data or losing access to your device can remove these records. Export backups regularly.</p><h2>Optional cloud sync</h2><p>If you sign in with Google and enable cloud sync, your account identifier and the financial records you choose to sync are processed using Supabase. Sync keeps your records available across signed-in devices. Local-only use does not require cloud sync.</p><p>Cloud providers process data under their own terms and privacy notices: <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google</a> and <a href="https://supabase.com/privacy">Supabase</a>. Their infrastructure may process data outside Sri Lanka.</p><h2>Website and app usage</h2><p>Kaasi uses Google Analytics to understand website visits and button presses, so we can see which features are useful. No transaction data is shared with Google Analytics.</p><h2>Storage and security</h2><p>Browser storage supports the app and its preferences. Signing in may also use authentication storage. A PIN limits access through the app interface; it is not a guarantee that records on an unlocked or compromised device cannot be accessed. No system can guarantee complete security.</p><h2>Your choices and requests</h2><p>You can export your records, stop using cloud sync, and clear local app data using the app or browser controls. Clearing local data does not by itself delete a cloud copy. Email <a href="mailto:aanjelo99@gmail.com">aanjelo99@gmail.com</a> to request access, correction or deletion of cloud data. We may need to verify that the account belongs to you before acting.</p><p>Cloud data is retained while needed to provide sync, until you request deletion, subject to provider backup retention and any applicable legal obligations. Contact us for details about a particular request.</p><h2>Changes</h2><p>We may update this notice as Kaasi changes. The date above identifies the latest revision.</p></div></article>
